  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4 and takes 15 minutes to prepare and 15 minutes to cook. Spiced lamb patties are shaped around skewers and cooked on a hot griddle pan until charred outside and just cooked through. Serve with flatbreads, sliced tomato and a spoonful of plain yoghurt."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: refrigerate the shaped kofte for at least 30 minutes before cooking if you have time. The mixture firms up and holds together much better on the griddle."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
